        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that we compete not only against other providers of pinpoint stimulation equipment and services, but also with companies that support the other primary means of hydraulically fracturing a horizontal well, including plug and perf and ball drop completions.",
